-current supports EIDE, but it (still) doesn't support it as an
installation device because you need to uncomment the ata driver in
GENERIC.

Pretty much any ncr/symbioses based PCI card should work as a boot
device, as well as a q-logic isp10x0.  Adaptec (ahc) adaptors will
work, but the SRM console doesn't understand how to boot from them.

Drew


